  "lore": "Springtrap is the undead animatronic form of William Afton from the Five Nights at Freddy’s series. After becoming trapped inside a faulty springlock suit, Afton survived as a decayed fusion of man and machine, haunting Fazbear locations while driven by agony and immortality."
